 you can see things are not getting  any easier for hal  stark ned reluctantly decides to go to  king's landing to be  robert's hand this decision will  ultimately  fracture their entire family some of  them go to king's landing  some of them stay in winterfell and jon  snow leaves for the wall  this will be the last time we see this  family all together  in winterfell everything will only get  more interesting  and complex from here on out now as of  right now  these chapters are still very similar to  how things were done in the show  but it won't be long before some of  these characters go in entirely  different directions  i hope you all will come back for those  videos as well i look forward to  discussing those chapters with you  for now i want to thank everyone for  watching the video i really appreciate  that as always  and i also want to thank those of you  who support the channel  i cannot thank you enough for that have  a great day everyone  i will see you again very soon bye  [Music]  [Music]  you
 

